diff --git a/packages/app/assets/branding/README.md b/packages/app/assets/branding/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..f669fc40e335678b7f7a64eec9fe6eb1cf31ca1a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/app/assets/branding/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# AiGo 01B brand source
+
+`aigo-01b-master.png` is the user-selected 01B “Momentum” mark, preserved byte-for-byte from `extras/Glossy Silver Ribbon Logo.png`.
+
+- Dimensions: 1254 × 1254 RGBA
+- SHA-256: `850F7CA1F5E23549A0777A21BF1B0F854211072B74E62BC8441FAD192E73D002`
+
+Regenerate app, web, PWA, and favicon assets from `packages/app` with:
+
+```sh
+npm run generate:brand-assets
+```
+
+To regenerate the Windows tray icon at the same time:
+
+```sh
+npm run generate:brand-assets -- --tray-output ../../../../../windows-tray/assets/aigo-tray.ico
+```
+
+Do not replace the master with a derived or flattened image. iOS, PWA, and tray variants intentionally use an opaque or dark-backed tile; in-app, splash, and Android foreground variants retain transparency.
